---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | EMON HOSSAIN"
  description="Privacy policy for emonhossain.pro. How we collect, use, and protect your data."
>
  <div class="container" style="padding: 4rem 1.5rem; max-width: 40rem;">
    <div class="eyebrow">LEGAL</div>
    <h1 style="font-size: 1.875rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--brand-ink); margin-top: 1rem;">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p style="color: var(--brand-stone-400); font-size: 0.75rem; margin-top: 0.5rem;">Last updated: July 2026</p>
    <div style="color: var(--brand-stone-600); font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.8; margin-top: 2rem; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1.5rem;">
      <p>This privacy policy explains how EMON HOSSAIN (&quot;I&quot;, &quot;me&quot;, &quot;my&quot;) collects, uses, and protects your personal data when you visit emonhossain.pro.</p>
      <h3 style="font-weight: 700; color: var(--brand-ink); font-size: 1rem;">1. Data I Collect</h3>
      <p>I collect minimal data: analytics (page views, referral source, browser type via cookies) and contact information you voluntarily provide via email or WhatsApp.</p>
      <h3 style="font-weight: 700; color: var(--brand-ink); font-size: 1rem;">2. How I Use Data</h3>
      <p>Analytics data is used to improve site content and performance. Contact information is used only to respond to your inquiries. I never sell personal data.</p>
      <h3 style="font-weight: 700; color: var(--brand-ink); font-size: 1rem;">3. Cookies</h3>
      <p>This site uses minimal cookies for analytics and basic functionality. You can decline non-essential cookies via the cookie banner.</p>
      <h3 style="font-weight: 700; color: var(--brand-ink); font-size: 1rem;">4. Third Parties</h3>
      <p>This site may use analytics services (e.g., Google Analytics) that set their own cookies. These services are governed by their own privacy policies.</p>
      <h3 style="font-weight: 700; color: var(--brand-ink); font-size: 1rem;">5. Contact</h3>
      <p>For privacy inquiries: <a href="mailto:contact@emonhossain.pro" style="color: var(--brand-indigo);">contact@emonhossain.pro</a></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>